{
  "an1.170:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 1.170–187 ",
  "an1.170:0.2": "The Chapter on One Individual ",
  "an1.170:1.0": "170 ",
  "an1.170:1.1": "“One individual, mendicants, arises in the world for the welfare and happiness of the people, out of sympathy for the world, for the benefit, welfare, and happiness of gods and humans. ",
  "an1.170:1.2": "What one individual? ",
  "an1.170:1.3": "The Realized One, the perfected one, the fully awakened Buddha. ",
  "an1.170:1.4": "This is the one individual, mendicants, who arises in the world for the welfare and happiness of the people, out of sympathy for the world, for the benefit, welfare, and happiness of gods and humans.” ",
  "an1.171:1.0": "171 ",
  "an1.171:1.1": "“The appearance of one individual, mendicants, is rare in the world. ",
  "an1.171:1.2": "What one individual? ",
  "an1.171:1.3": "The Realized One, the perfected one, the fully awakened Buddha. ",
  "an1.171:1.4": "This is the one individual, mendicants, whose appearance is rare in the world.” ",
  "an1.172:1.0": "172 ",
  "an1.172:1.1": "“One individual, mendicants, arises in the world who is an incredible human being. ",
  "an1.172:1.2": "What one individual? ",
  "an1.172:1.3": "The Realized One, the perfected one, the fully awakened Buddha. ",
  "an1.172:1.4": "This is the one individual, mendicants, who arises in the world who is an incredible human being.” ",
  "an1.173:1.0": "173 ",
  "an1.173:1.1": "“The death of one individual, mendicants, is regretted by many people. ",
